{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"agent_message","text":"The ontology already contains the primate midget/parasol classes named in the epic, which narrows this to refinement rather than pure term addition. I’m reading the current axioms around those classes now to see whether the missing piece is the formal ON/OFF and mono/bistratified structure described in the issue body."}}
