hat says it is not bronchial). In the literature, the name \\\"club-like\\\" isn't used.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4032000 <http://orcid.org/0000-0001-6757-4744>)\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4032000 \"club cell of the urethra epithelium\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7258-9596\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4032000 \"club-like cell of the prostatic urethra epithelium\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:30566875\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4032000 \"prostate club cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:30566875\") rdfs:comment obo:CL_4032000 \"Club cells typically refer to bronchiolar exocrine cells found in the lungs. This cell type is given the name club cell due to their similarity to club cells in the lungs.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4032000 \"club-like cell of the urethral epithelium\")\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4032000 obo:CL_1000296)\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4032000 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002292 obo:PR_000014505))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4032001 (reelin GABAergic cortical interneuron)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:23803971\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4032001 \"A GABAergic interneuron located in the cerebral cortex that expresses reelin (rln).\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4032001 <http://orcid.org/0000-0001-6757-4744>)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4032001 \"http://orcid.org/0000-0001-5501-853X\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4032001 \"http://orcid.org/0000-0001-7476-6306\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:29904965\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4032001 \"rln GABAergic cortical interneuron\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4032001 \"reelin GABAergic cortical interneuron\")\nEquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4032001 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000099 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo