:PR_000001177))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4023030 (L2/3/5 fan Martinotti sst GABAergic interneuron (Mmus))\n\nAnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000028 obo:CL_4023030 \"L2/3/5 fan Martinotti sst interneuron (Mus)\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:27225074\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:27477017\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:28254942\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:29326172\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4023030 \"A sst GABAergic cortical interneuron that has \\\"fanning-out' Martinotti morphology that is found in layer 2/3/5 of the cerebral cortex. They have local axon arbor and long ascending axons that spreads horizontally and arborizes significantly in L1.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4023030 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7258-9596>)\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4023030 \"L2/3/5 fan Martinotti SST (Mus musculus)\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:inSubset obo:CL_4023030 cl:BDS_subset)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:33184512\") rdfs:comment obo:CL_4023030 \"L2/3/5 fan Martionotti SST cells have an adapting firing pattern and non-zero afterdepolarization (ADP).\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4023030 \"L2/3/5 fan Martinotti sst GABAergic interneuron (Mmus)\")\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4023030 obo:CL_0000099)\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4023030 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000053 obo:PATO_0070009))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4023030 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0000956))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4023030 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002162 obo:NCBITaxon_10090))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4023030 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0061534))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4023030 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002292 obo:PR_P60041))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4023031 (L4 sst Martinotti interneuron (Mmus))\n\nAnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000028 obo:CL_4023031 \"L4 sst interneuron (Mus)\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:33184512\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4023031 \"A sst GABAergic cortical interneuron with a soma found in lower L2/3 and upper 5, L4 Sst cells have Martinotti morphology with ascending axons but denser local axons and sparser ‘fanning-out’ projections to L1. L4 sst cells have smaller membrane time constant to calb2 (L2/3/5 fan Martinotti Cell) and non-zero afterdepolarization (ADP).\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4023031 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7258-9596>)\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4023031 \"L4 SST (Mus musculus)\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:inSubset obo:CL_4023031 cl:BDS_subset)\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4023031 \"L4 sst Martinotti interneuron (Mmus)\")\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4023031 obo:CL_0000099)\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4023031 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000053 obo:PATO_0070007))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4023031 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0005393))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4023031 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002162 obo:NCBITaxon_10090))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4023031 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0061534))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4023031 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002292 obo:PR_P60041))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4023032 (ON retinal ganglion cell)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4023032 <http://orcid.org/0000-0001-7258-9596>)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19602302\") rdfs:comment obo:CL_4023032 \"A retinal ganglion cell that is depolarized by illumination of its receptive field center.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4023032 \"ON retinal ganglion cell\")\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4023032 obo:CL_0000740)\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4023033 (OFF retinal ganglion cell)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19602302\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4023033 \"A retinal ganglion cell that is depolarized by decreased illumination of their receptive field center.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4023033 <http://orcid.org/0000-0001-7258-9596>)\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4023033 \"OFF retinal ganglion cell\")\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4023033 obo:CL_0000740)\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4023034 (obsolete L2/3 pvalb-like sst GABAergic cortical interneuron (Mus musculus))\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:33184512\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4023034 \"OBSOLETE A sst GABAergic cortical interneuron transcriptomically between the sst and the pvalb families with a soma found in L2/3. Some L2/3 PV-like sst cells have Martinotti morphology while some have basket cell morphology. L2/3 PV-like sst cells have lower AP width and higher firing rate than typical Sst subclass cells. L2/3 PV-like sst cells have high maximum firing rate variability, with many classified as belonging to the pvalb subclass on the basis of electrophysiology.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_4023034 <https://github.com/obophenotype/brain_data_standards_ontologies/issues/231>)\nAnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0100001 obo:CL_4023034 obo:PCL_1000002)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4023034 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7258-9596>)\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4023034 \"L2/3 PV-like SST Mus)\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:CL_4023034 \"Moved to PCL. Use PCL:1000002 instead.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4023034 \"obsolete L2/3 pvalb-like sst GABAergic cortical interneuron (Mus musculus)\")\nAnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated obo:CL_4023034 \"true\"^^xsd:boolean)\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4023035 (lateral ganglionic eminence derived neuron)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"wikipediaversioned:Ganglionic_eminence&oldid=1186824360\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4023035 \"A neuron that is derived from a precursor cell in the lateral ganglion eminence.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4023035 \"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7258-9596\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4023035 \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7073-9172\")\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
